( Expected-error test, F4 T6d C59 (owner decision 2026-10-11): without
  materi_displacement (velocity-integrated truss), group_truss_memory
  -total (or -total_linear) is an input error, as in the Professional
  02-08-2026 ("materi_displacement should be initialised").
  EXPECTED_ERROR: group_truss_memory -total or -total_linear needs materi_displacement to be initialised
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_velocity_integrated
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
element 1 -truss 1 2
group_type 0 -truss
group_truss_area 0 1.
group_truss_elasti_young 0 100.
group_truss_memory 0 -total_linear
bounda_dof 1 1 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx
bounda_time 2 0. -0.5 1. -0.5
bounda_dof 3 2 -vely
bounda_time 3 0. 1. 1. 1.
control_timestep 10 0.1 1.
end_data
